all e.p. captures allowed                     -> *2  outcome N
none allowed                                  -> 0  outcome P
all but W c5xb6                               -> *2  outcome N
only W c5xb6                                  -> 0  outcome P
all but W a5xb6                               -> *2  outcome N
all but B b4xa3                               -> ↑  outcome L
all but W b5xc6                               -> ↓  outcome R
only B b4xa3                                  -> ↓  outcome R
only W b5xc6                                  -> ↑  outcome L
only B b4xa3 + W b5xc6                        -> *2  outcome N
